          "text_excerpt": "Clinical Trials | SAGE Veterinary Centers Skip to Primary Content Give Us a Call Emergency Emergency Contact Us Contact Us Who We Are About Us Giving Back Share Your Story Our Team - Campbell Our Team - Concord Our Team - Dublin Our Team - Redwood City Our Team - San Francisco Services View all Services Campbell Services Concord Services Dublin Services Redwood City Services San Francisco Services For Pet Owners For Pet Owners Self-Service Portal Appointment Information Online Pharmacy Grief Support Pet Owner FAQs For Veterinarians For Veterinarians E-Learning Portal Clinical Trials Request Records Veterinarian FAQs Careers Give Us a Call Emergency Contact Us Clinical Trials SAGE Veterinary Centers' veterinarians and patients participate in a variety of clinical studies. SAGE Oncology has a robust Oncology service that includes 8 Medical Oncologists and 1 Radiation Oncologist. The Oncology teams are committed to contributing to the advancement of medicine, and to helping their patients with clinical trials. Here are the trials in which we are participating. PetCure Oncology Osteosarcoma & Lung Tumor Trial PetCure Onocology Osteosarcoma Trial: Learn More > PetCure Oncology Lung Tumor Trial: Learn More > ImpriMed Canine MCT Research: Learn More > Feline Lymphoma Research: Learn More > Please check this page regularly for clinical trial posts. You may also follow us on Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, and Instagram to receive updates. Meet Our Clinical Trials Coordinator Rebekah Belasco, RVT Rebekah Belasco has been with SAGE since 2021 on the Oncology team in our SAGE Dublin hospital. Prior to SAGE, she served in the US Navy for 4 years working on an aircraft carrier and on hover crafts, and then pursued a career in veterinary medicine. She is a licensed veterinary technician (graduate of Carrington College) with experience in general practice and shelter medicine. Rebekah believes in contributing to the community and the veterinary profession to improve the future care of our patients in her role as Clinical Trials Coordinator. Contact Rebekah Find a Location Services Self-Service Portal Online Pharmacy Contact Us Emergency Terms & Conditions Accessibility Privacy Policy Careers Cookie Preferences Do Not Sell or Share My Information © Copyright 2026",
