          "text_excerpt": "Find Veterinary Clinical Trials | PetTrials Australia How it works Find trials Research areas About FAQ Sign in Upload vet history Find trials Search veterinary clinical trials in Australia. Browse active and upcoming clinical trials for dogs and cats across Australian universities and research institutions. PetTrials aggregates trial opportunities from veterinary schools nationwide, so you can find the right study for your pet in one place. Searching is always free. 7 Trials listed 7 Institutions tracked Free To search and register All species Dogs Cats All conditions Cancer / Oncology Arthritis / Joint disease Skin / Dermatology Neurology / Cognitive Gastrointestinal Endocrine / Diabetes Infectious disease Ageing / Longevity All states Queensland New South Wales Victoria Western Australia South Australia National All status Recruiting now Coming soon No trials match your search Try adjusting your filters or search terms. New trials are added regularly, so check back often or register for alerts. Register for trial alerts International registries Explore trials worldwide . While PetTrials focuses on Australian trials, these international registries list hundreds of veterinary studies. Some may accept remote participation or international enrolment. AVMA Veterinary Clinical Trials Registry American Veterinary Medical Association The largest registry of veterinary clinical trials, with 300+ active studies across US universities. Searchable by species, condition, and location. Free to search, no account required. Search AVMA registry → Dog Aging Project (TRIAD) Texas A&M / University of Washington Landmark longitudinal study of ageing in companion dogs. Includes the TRIAD rapamycin trial testing whether the drug can extend healthy lifespan. Open to dogs across the United States. Learn more → VIN Clinical Trials Veterinary Information Network Repository of veterinary clinical trials maintained by the world's largest online veterinary community. Primarily US-based studies. Requires VIN membership for full access. Visit VIN → Cannot find a trial for your pet? Upload your pet's vet history for free. When a new trial opens that matches your pet's condition, breed, or age, you will be notified automatically. Upload vet history, free Contact us Are you a researcher? List your trial on PetTrials for free. Australia's first platform connecting pet owners with veterinary clinical trials. Free for owners. Free for researchers. A division of Altered Carbon Synthetic Biology Pty Ltd Platform How it works Find trials Research areas Upload vet history About About PetTrials FAQ Contact BAARK (sibling brand) Legal Terms of Service Privacy Policy © 2026 Altered Carbon Synthetic Biology Pty Ltd. All rights reserved. PetTrials is operated by Altered Carbon Synthetic Biology Pty Ltd (ACN 649 555 993). PetTrials and the PetTrials logo are trade marks of Altered Carbon Synthetic Biology Pty Ltd.",
