          "text_length": 2519,
          "text_excerpt": "Clinical Studies | Discover, Participate, Innovate Today — VMD Sciences 0 Skip to Content About Why We Exist Drug Shortages Meet the Team Glossary Testimonials Managed Access Clinical Studies Insights News Case Studies Events Contact Login Account Find a Global Treatment Open Menu Close Menu About Why We Exist Drug Shortages Meet the Team Glossary Testimonials Managed Access Clinical Studies Insights News Case Studies Events Contact Login Account Find a Global Treatment Open Menu Close Menu Folder: About Back Why We Exist Drug Shortages Meet the Team Glossary Testimonials Managed Access Clinical Studies Folder: Insights Back News Case Studies Events Contact Login Account Find a Global Treatment Clinical Study Solutions. A majority of Animal Clinical Trials take place in University settings. However, practices cite a lack of resources and distance to active trials as barriers to participation. When we prioritize studies, we are contributing to the improvement of quality, safety, and innovation in both Animal and Human health practices, in your community. Bridging the gap between cutting-edge advancements and everyday veterinary practice. At the heart of VMD Insights and Clinical Studies lies a steadfast commitment to in-clinic animal studies. We recognize that every pet is unique, and their health challenges often require tailored solutions. That's why we are working to offer full-service studies, meticulously guided from inception to completion by our team of dedicated professionals. By expading these studies directly within our community, we bridge the gap between cutting-edge advancements and everyday veterinary practice, ensuring that our findings translate seamlessly into tangible benefits for our beloved animal companions. This localized approach not only facilitates access to innovative treatments but also fosters a collaborative environment where veterinarians, pet owners, and researchers work hand in hand to advance the boundaries of veterinary medicine. Through in-clinic studies, we not only improve individual patient outcomes, but also contribute to the collective knowledge base, paving the way for a healthier, happier future for pets everywhere. Customized Solutions to Make You Research Ready. End-to-End Research Support features personalized services to create a truly turn-key site for veterinarians. Learn More about Clinical Studies ACCELERATING ACCESS TO GLOBAL VETERINARY MEDICINE © 2026 VMD Sciences. All rights reserved. Connect Privacy Policy Terms of Service",
