          "text_excerpt": "For Veterinarians TheraJan, LLC. produces an experimental canine EGFR/HER2 Peptide Immunotherapeutic. Safety and efficacy have NOT yet been established by the USDA. For use under supervision/ administration of a licensed veterinary oncologist. TheraJan LLC Home For Pet Owners For Veterinarians FAQs Contact Us Find a Clinic Find a Clinical Trial Site The following 12 sites have been approved by the USDA to administer the EGFR/HER2 Peptide Cancer Immunotherapeutic vaccine: Chelsea Tripp, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) Bridge Animal Referral Center 8401 Main St. Edmonds, WA 98026 Rance Sellon, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) Washington State University Department of Veterinary Clinical Sciences Pullman, WA 99164-6610 Karina Valerius DVM DACVIM (Oncology) and Jeanne Lane, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) MedVet Cincinnati 3964 Red Bank Rd. Fairfax, OH 45227 Betsy Hershey, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) CVA Integrative Veterinary Oncology 2501 N 32nd Street Phoenix, AZ. 85008 Roberta Portela, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) and Mark Byrum, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) MedVet Chicago 3305 N. California Ave. Chicago, IL 60618 Brendan Boostrom, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) MedVet Northern Virginia 8614 Centreville Rd. Manassas, VA 20110 Katie Wright, DVM , DACVIM (Oncology), MedVet Salt Lake City 331 W. Bearcat Dr. Salt Lake City, UT 84115 Rochelle Prudic, DVM , DACVIM (Oncology), MedVet Cleveland 20400 Emerald Pkwy Cleveland, OH 44135 Christine Anderson, DVM DACVIM (Oncology), MedVet Pittsburgh 2810 Washington Rd. McMurray, PA 15317 Melissa Miller, DVM (DACVIM Oncology) Partner Veterinary Urgent Care 6506 W. Broad Street Richmond, VA 23230 Lori Cesario, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) Hope Veterinary Oncology 1885 Knoll Drive Ventura, CA 93003 Lindsay Thalheim, DVM DACVIM (Oncology) 46 Maltbie Ave. Stamford, CT 06902 TheraJan LLC",
